    "output": "Preserve the accepted CO2 109-state/44-ledger/6-event-total/17-balance stored rows, forcing_step_index, original units and microsecond UTC. The committed v2 journal retains management before/after state and derived quantities but excludes transient after_rhs; do not manufacture Solar/CO2 per-event RHS diagnostics or perform read calculations. A ppm value needs the explicit wet/dry basis: require the stored source_program matched to manifest.program_sha256, select basis by the original stored forcing_step_index (not latest forcing at the same UTC, which can be unconfirmed on hold), and expose only basis metadata, not raw boundary parameters/forcing. The trusted current reader later supplies its existing reader._context[program] in the same read session; projection alone does not authorize or authenticate pages. Versioned new family and finite/closed schemas, body limits, privacy and actual original/fresh/SCRAM tests are required before acceptance.",
